OL,3,GNEWSAFour headline acts announced for
OL,4,ABoardmasters
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoardmasters has announced its headline
OL,7,Facts and, for the first time, one will
OL,8,Fplay on the Thursday night of the
OL,9,FCornwall festival.
OL,11,FThe festival at Watergate Bay, Newquay,
OL,12,Fis set to run from 4 - 8 August, with
OL,13,FDutch DJ Chris Stassy headlining on
OL,14,FThursday, Chase & Status on Friday,
OL,15,FDisclosure on Saturday night and Wolf
OL,16,FAlice on Sunday night.
OL,18,FIt will be the first time the main
OL,19,Fstage hosts live music on a Thursday,
OL,20,Fwith Chris Stassy headlining in
OL,21,Fpartnership with BBC Radio 1 Dance.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
