OL,3,GNEWSAFour headline acts announced for
OL,4,ABoardmasters
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestival director Rob Spring said:
OL,7,F"Opening the main stage on Thursday is
OL,8,Fsomething we've wanted to do for a long
OL,9,Ftime, it gives people a full extra day
OL,10,Fof live music on the clifftops."
